      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "version": 1,
      "text": "4.  cookieParser, CSRF (unless excluded), body parser (50mb)\n5.  ValidationPipe\n6.  ThrottlerGuard\n7.  Route guard (JwtAuthGuard etc.)\n8.  Controller binds DTO → Service\n9.  Service: authorize (ownership / plan / identity) → Prisma and/or cache\n10. Optional: enqueue BullMQ, emit in-process event,\n    socket to room user:{id}\n11. AllExceptionsFilter shapes errors; 5xx → Sentry/Slack\n12. JSON response",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4.  cookieParser, CSRF (unless excluded), body parser (50mb)\n5.  ValidationPipe\n6.  ThrottlerGuard\n7.  Route guard (JwtAuthGuard etc.)\n8.  Controller binds DTO → Service\n9.  Service: authorize (ownership / plan / identity) → Prisma and/or cache\n10. Optional: enqueue BullMQ, emit in-process event,\n    socket to room user:{id}\n11. AllExceptionsFilter shapes errors; 5xx → Sentry/Slack\n12. JSON response",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
